  "bodyHash": "13155e0132e1fa53",
  "content": "<h4 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Добро пожаловать в RealmRPG, серию модов, наполненную приключениямиadditions medieval fantasy!&nbsp;</strong></span></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Мод «Pots & Mimics»</strong>&nbsp;мод улучшает冒險和探索方面的Мinecraft，通過添加隨機寶藏瓶增強冒險體驗。</span></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模塊專為&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/play-as-dragon-gothic-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Play as Dragon Gothic Edition modpack</a>&nbsp;設計，但您也可以在不使用該模塊的情況下運行它，或者在您的自定義模塊中使用！<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>版本狀態：<br>✔️ </strong>支持穩定版本。包含所有功能，且可能會被更新。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🦎 - 具有美麗動畫並需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a>。如果動畫對您不工作，請在着色器設置中禁用 Entity Shadows !<br>❌ 不支持舊版本，可能存在bug。缺少某些功能的機率很高，且不打算更新。</span><br><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✔️🦎 1.20.1 [Forge] - Release</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✔️🦎 1.19.4 [Forge]&nbsp;- Release</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✔️🦎 1.19.2 [Forge] - Release</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✔️🦎 1.18.2 [Forge] - Release</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">❌ 1.17.1 [Forge] - Backport</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">❌ 1.16.5 [Forge] - Backport</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">❌ 1.15.2 [Forge]&nbsp;- Backport</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">❌ 1.14.4 [Forge]&nbsp;- Backport</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">❌ 1.12.2 [Forge]&nbsp;- Backport<br></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252felysiumup.com%252f%253fref%253dbusiness%2526source%253dblackaures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/BlackAures1/image_lib/blob/main/ElysiumUP_pots.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"2054\" height=\"602\"></strong></span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Pots<br></strong><em>'Remains of forgotten civilization, scattered around the underground caves'</em></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可以在主世界洞穴、地獄和終界找到。含有隨機獎勵，使探索更加多樣化和有趣。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">打破瓶子會獲得各種材料甚至附魔書，但不要忘記危險 —— 其中一些是螃蟹的家，它們會突襲捕食不幸的探險者。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只有使用精靈之淚才能采集瓶，否則會掉落寶物（並可能 spawn 出一只螃蟹）。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">花瓶的生成沒有方塊或生物群系限制，這在使用新增生物群系的mod時非常好。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掉落物品取決於 loot_tables。您可以通過簡單的 datapack 重新平衡 mod。<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">裝飾性花瓶與寶藏花瓶相同，但價格便宜、安全且可合成。它具有不同的庫存圖標，不包含金粒。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">裝飾性和寶藏花瓶都可以放置大多數植物，包括其他mod的植物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">要製作變體，將泥土方塊與四個磚塊、地獄磚或爆裂果實組合在一起。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Pot Crab<br></strong><em>'Underground crabs that ambush to eat an unlucky adventurer'</em></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">打破主世界的寶藏花瓶時有一定機率 spawn。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">速度慢且傷害低。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可能掉落 0-2 個蘋果。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Poison Pot Crab<br></strong><em>'Dangerous pot crab species that uses venomous glands to hunt prey'</em></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">罕見的 Pot Crab 變體。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有機會給目標中毒。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可能掉落 0-2 個蜘蛛眼。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Nether Pot Crab<br></strong><em>'Distant relatives of the earthen pot crabs that live near molten lava'</em></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">打破地獄的寶藏花瓶時有一定機率 spawn。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">中等生命值、速度和擊退抗性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有機會燒燬目標。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">害怕水且不會游泳。接觸水時會受傷。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可能掉落 0-2 個金黃蘿蔔。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Ender Pot Crab<br></strong><em>'Pot crabs brought to this alien world by random explorers from Overworld'</em></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">打破終界的寶藏花瓶時有一定機率 spawn。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高生命值和傷害。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">無法被擊退，但可以擊退你。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有 30% 機率減緩目標速度。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可能掉落 0-2 個菌絲果實。</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Credits:<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod author - <strong>NoCube</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Made with - <strong>MCreator, Blockbench, PaintNet</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Sounds - <strong>Terraria (Remixed crawdad sounds + random free sfx)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Inspired by<strong> - Terraria &amp; TModLoader Mods</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pots-and-mimics-rpg/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">Screenshots</a> shader - <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.complementary.dev%252freimagined%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complimentary Reimagined</a></strong><br><br><strong>Permissions &amp; FAQ:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您可以在視頻和模塊包中使用此模塊，只要註明作者並且下載鏈接指向這裏即可。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">不允許將此模塊的資源（紋理、模型等）用於自己的項目。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">不允許將此模塊上傳到其他網站和啟動器。這也意味着不能放到 Aternos 上。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fabric 或新功能 backports 不在計劃內！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎提交錯誤報告和再平衡想法。<br><br><strong>更多 Realm RPG mods：<br><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nocubes-sea-dwellers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/891/22/638332229090166009.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-creep-crop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/895/730/638340578799643798.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-imps-demons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/886/558/638323109380204126.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-dragon-wyrms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/872/792/638291974755181770.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-fallen-adventurers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/882/139/638313378229849817.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pots-and-mimics-rpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/847/493/638246901123812282.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gothic-rpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/851/851/638254279369665236.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><br></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
